      "content": "what are you talking about with goblins and lair maps? i need a technical diagnosis, not a story. \n\ncan we just focus on the actual data? the jitter is specifically spikey between hop 2 (172.16.5.1) and hop 3 (198.51.100.1). with that 45ms jitter, does that point toward an interface issue on the 172.16.5.1 router, or is it more likely congestion somewhere in the provider backbone?",
